{"title":"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d278803d72fcc493afb1559174a483aa7f41d143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> square grid has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dots equally\nspaced. How many squares (of all sizes)\ncan you make using four of these dots\nas vertices? Two examples are shown.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/c/25cf0db35690d9453f4c01ff44569a8e74957ba1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  for (int x=0; x&lt;3; ++x) {for (int y=0; y&lt;3; ++y) {dot((x,y));dot((x+4,y));} } draw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(0,1)--cycle,black); draw((4,1)--(5,0)--(6,1)--(5,2)--cycle,black); draw((3,-1)--(3,3),dashed);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"165\" />\n</p><p>(b) How many for a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d4eeb6a966219df4ac79cfc9981ec095e6be0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p>(c) How many for a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/7/197151a067f49bd4daa1952d1a4fac322409f0a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p>(d) How many for an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/0/320118921c1c38ac60455d4f3fb3bf0dce41d052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(N+1) \\times (N+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />  grid of dots?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> (b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (c) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (d) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/d/11dcae5ae256a106793d2780e04cfe74fd7376b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\cdot n^2 + 2\\cdot (n-1)^2+3\\cdot (n-2)^2 + \\cdots + n\\cdot 1^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II\">2010 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Question</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNC